 - 2026-06-02: RESUME bounded checkpointed training (chunk 2): load exp3734's checkpoint and train another bounded chunk (<=1500s) of BOTH the tiny EBT + matched AR, accumulating steps and extending the stability diagnostics. Gated on exp3734 having trained >0 steps. THESIS-A genuine kill-gate part-(a), run 2. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_cuda; results/experiment_3735_bounded_train_chunk2_resume.json
 - 2026-06-02: REAL Thesis-A kill-gate part-(a) VERDICT over the GENUINE training run (exp3734 + exp3735), SUPERSEDING the false-negative exp3729: did the tiny EBT train to STABLE convergence within the bounded 3090 budget? Emit green_light_342 (BARE bool). GREEN-LIGHT the matched-COMPUTE comparison only if genuinely stable. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: real_kill_gate_part_a_untested_training_did_not_complete; results/experiment_3736_real_kill_gate_part_a_verdict.json
 - 2026-06-02: Thesis-A kill-gate part-(b) VERDICT: at EQUAL inference compute, does the EBT beat the matched AR baseline on held-out reasoning accuracy? Reads exp3738 (matched-compute) honestly. A clean NEGATIVE (AR >= EBT at equal compute, gap does not narrow) bounds the route -- as valuable as a positive. States the .342 Thesis-A outcome. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: kill_gate_part_b_not_run_part_a_did_not_green_light; results/experiment_3739_kill_gate_part_b_verdict.json
+- 2026-06-02: FR-11 continuous self-learning v15 — Tier-1 ONLINE stabilizer-efficacy tracker for EBT training: from the exp3734/3735 stability diagnostics, track which stabilizers (random-alpha, replay buffer, Langevin noise, grad-clip, KL-term CD) correlate with NO-divergence across chunks, upweight the effective ones, and recommend a recipe for the next bounded run. CPU counter-updates only (the Tier-1 hardware path). The self-learning experiment mandated by research-program.md. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fr11_v15_tier1_stabilizer_efficacy_tracker_recipe_recommended_state_persisted_preliminary_over_3_chunks; results/experiment_3740_fr11_self_learning_v15_stabilizer_tracker.json
